  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "{\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"scope\":\"Whole slender long-legged hornless running-rhino reconstruction with three toes on every foot.\",\"scientific_limits\":{\"en\":\"Whole living reconstruction, not an articulated single specimen or scan. AMNH1480 skull and LACM3342/42889 skeletal mount are separate references. Skull250mm is approximate projection from an image ruler; body dimensions are artistic estimates consistent with pony-sized museum description, not measured mounted bones. Soft tissue, ears, tail covering and colors are inferred.\",\"zh\":\"完整活体复原，非单一完整标本或扫描。AMNH1480颅与LACM3342/42889装架为不同参考。颅250毫米是图尺投影估值；身体尺寸是符合馆方小马级描述的复原估值，非实测骨长。软组织、耳形、尾被毛与颜色为推断。\"},\"original_inventory_ordinal\":627,\"taxon\":\"Hyracodon nebraskensis\",\"classification\":\"Hyracodontidae, Rhinocerotoidea, Perissodactyla\",\"scale\":{\"unit\":\"meter\",\"skull_length_model_m\":0.25,\"nose_rump_model_m\":1.35,\"shoulder_height_model_m\":0.8,\"tail_model_m\":0.35,\"status\":\"Skull approximate image-ruler projection from AMNH1480 (10cm bar), not caliper measurement. Wholebody and tail estimates use AMNH pony-size description and skeletal proportions; perspective mount not used as exact ruler.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Slender long limbs with substantial clearance below ribcage, unlike a barrel-bodied short-legged Teleoceras or hippo-like Metamynodon.\",\"No nasal or frontal horn: smooth nasal silhouette.\",\"Three distinct short hoofed toes on all FOUR feet, broad central toe and smaller flanking toes; not horse single hoof.\",\"Moderately long neck and relatively large deep-cheeked head with constricted muzzle, not tiny deer head or giant Paraceratherium neck.\",\"Compact non-barrel torso, visible shoulder/hip limb transitions, thin moderately long tail.\",\"Conservative neutral coat, no exact copying of artist striping or unsupported horn/tusk ornament.\"]}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：{\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"scope\":\"Whole slender long-legged hornless running-rhino reconstruction with three toes on every foot.\",\"scientific_limits\":{\"en\":\"Whole living reconstruction, not an articulated single specimen or scan. AMNH1480 skull and LACM3342/42889 skeletal mount are separate references. Skull250mm is approximate projection from an image ruler; body dimensions are artistic estimates consistent with pony-sized museum description, not measured mounted bones. Soft tissue, ears, tail covering and colors are inferred.\",\"zh\":\"完整活体复原，非单一完整标本或扫描。AMNH1480颅与LACM3342/42889装架为不同参考。颅250毫米是图尺投影估值；身体尺寸是符合馆方小马级描述的复原估值，非实测骨长。软组织、耳形、尾被毛与颜色为推断。\"},\"original_inventory_ordinal\":627,\"taxon\":\"Hyracodon nebraskensis\",\"classification\":\"Hyracodontidae, Rhinocerotoidea, Perissodactyla\",\"scale\":{\"unit\":\"meter\",\"skull_length_model_m\":0.25,\"nose_rump_model_m\":1.35,\"shoulder_height_model_m\":0.8,\"tail_model_m\":0.35,\"status\":\"Skull approximate image-ruler projection from AMNH1480 (10cm bar), not caliper measurement. Wholebody and tail estimates use AMNH pony-size description and skeletal proportions; perspective mount not used as exact ruler.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Slender long limbs with substantial clearance below ribcage, unlike a barrel-bodied short-legged Teleoceras or hippo-like Metamynodon.\",\"No nasal or frontal horn: smooth nasal silhouette.\",\"Three distinct short hoofed toes on all FOUR feet, broad central toe and smaller flanking toes; not horse single hoof.\",\"Moderately long neck and relatively large deep-cheeked head with constricted muzzle, not tiny deer head or giant Paraceratherium neck.\",\"Compact non-barrel torso, visible shoulder/hip limb transitions, thin moderately long tail.\",\"Conservative neutral coat, no exact copying of artist striping or unsupported horn/tusk ornament.\"]}"
  },
